1
00:01:53,226 --> 00:02:03,276
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com

2
00:02:04,153 --> 00:02:08,483
No living creature was hurt during
the production of this show.

3
00:02:09,304 --> 00:02:10,804
Malhun Hatun...

4
00:02:11,204 --> 00:02:13,534
I'll have a child, won't I?

5
00:02:15,279 --> 00:02:17,189
I'll give you a child.

6
00:02:18,330 --> 00:02:20,440
Thank you my Lord.

7
00:02:20,862 --> 00:02:23,362
Thank you my Lord...

8
00:02:24,093 --> 00:02:26,273
... you answered my pray.

9
00:02:27,052 --> 00:02:29,172
You didn't leave me without a child.

10
00:02:35,199 --> 00:02:36,609
Malhun Hatun.

11
00:02:37,484 --> 00:02:40,424
You fulfilled my longing.

12
00:02:40,796 --> 00:02:45,426
You brought heaven to my tent.

13
00:02:46,058 --> 00:02:48,748
Now, tell me.

14
00:02:49,617 --> 00:02:51,827
You can wish anything from me.

15
00:02:54,157 --> 00:02:58,317
My happiness is seeing you happy.

16
00:03:01,852 --> 00:03:07,152
Even more, If you give birth
to a son...

17
00:03:07,887 --> 00:03:12,217
He'll be a heir of mine.
Hay Masha Allah (praise be).

18
00:03:24,972 --> 00:03:26,472
Can I come in?

19
00:03:28,773 --> 00:03:31,253
Come.
Come.

20
00:03:34,289 --> 00:03:35,989
Bala.

21
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,810
I'll have a child.

22
00:04:23,379 --> 00:04:26,729
This is good news for all of us.

23
00:04:27,549 --> 00:04:29,199
It is.

24
00:04:29,403 --> 00:04:30,403
It is.

25
00:04:37,671 --> 00:04:39,181
Thank Lord.

26
00:04:40,497 --> 00:04:42,177
Thank Lord.

27
00:04:42,518 --> 00:04:44,258
Thank Lord.

28
00:04:59,899 --> 00:05:01,829
Excuse me, my Bey.

29
00:05:02,711 --> 00:05:04,461
Of course.

30
00:07:34,058 --> 00:07:35,498
Osman Bey.

31
00:07:35,822 --> 00:07:38,231
This must be between us for now.

32
00:07:38,231 --> 00:07:41,131
We need to be sure about our child's
health condition first.

33
00:07:41,238 --> 00:07:44,855
We shouldn't raise people's hopes
for nothing.

34
00:07:44,855 --> 00:07:47,435
Allah forbid. Allah forbid.

35
00:07:48,212 --> 00:07:50,062
But you are right.

36
00:07:50,724 --> 00:07:55,274
You shall rest.
Take care of yourself and our child.

37
00:07:57,585 --> 00:08:00,045
And you shall make your wish.

38
00:08:03,893 --> 00:08:05,673
We shall not tell anyone.

39
00:08:05,754 --> 00:08:08,324
I'll talk to the healer Hatun.

40
00:08:08,953 --> 00:08:10,573
Can we come in?

41
00:08:11,497 --> 00:08:13,227
Come.

42
00:08:20,269 --> 00:08:21,529
From now on...

43
00:08:24,614 --> 00:08:27,364
You must take a good care of
Malhun Hatun.

44
00:08:28,053 --> 00:08:30,613
Do not let her work.

45
00:08:31,449 --> 00:08:35,879
Do not upset her.

46
00:08:36,728 --> 00:08:39,108
- As you command, my Bey.
- Eyvallah (thank you).

47
00:08:39,542 --> 00:08:40,992
Eyvallah.

48
00:08:45,924 --> 00:08:48,104
May Allah bless you.

49
00:09:03,575 --> 00:09:06,275
My Hanım, are you okay?

50
00:09:06,292 --> 00:09:08,042
I am fine, Alaca.

51
00:10:34,701 --> 00:10:36,711
Good news, Bala.

52
00:10:36,723 --> 00:10:38,543
Good news.

53
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:40,940
Good news to you, Osman Bey.

54
00:10:43,971 --> 00:10:48,241
What are you waiting for, Osman Bey?
Won't you notify your tribe?

55
00:10:53,165 --> 00:10:54,805
Not now.

56
00:10:55,665 --> 00:10:58,385
The tribe should not know it at
the moment.

57
00:10:59,976 --> 00:11:03,746
Also Malhun Hatun wants to be sure
the baby is healthy.

58
00:11:04,398 --> 00:11:06,258
She is right.

59
00:11:07,149 --> 00:11:08,949
- She is right.
- Yes.

60
00:11:11,865 --> 00:11:14,185
We shall not excite the tribe.

61
00:11:14,628 --> 00:11:17,353
Well thought, my Osman.

62
00:11:17,353 --> 00:11:20,192
It is wise to hide it until you are sure.

63
00:11:20,192 --> 00:11:21,502
Right.

64
00:11:52,130 --> 00:11:53,530
Bala?

65
00:11:54,814 --> 00:11:56,834
What is wrong with Malhun Hatun?

66
00:11:57,292 --> 00:12:00,092
She is good, Gonca.
She felt dizzy a little.

67
00:12:00,241 --> 00:12:01,971
She needs a rest.

68
00:12:29,697 --> 00:12:31,229
Salam Alaikum.
(peace be upon you).

69
00:12:31,229 --> 00:12:33,329
Alaikum salam.
(you too)

70
00:12:34,233 --> 00:12:37,473
My brothers and sisters are coming
from Germiyan Land, Master Davut.

71
00:12:37,473 --> 00:12:40,642
They are willing to fight on Osman Bey's
side like me.

72
00:12:40,642 --> 00:12:44,712
Masha Allah(praise be!)
This is what we call good news.

73
00:12:44,937 --> 00:12:47,037
Did you hear, Boran Alp?

74
00:12:48,784 --> 00:12:53,524
A valiant joined our tribe and paved the
way for one thousand valiants, Master Davut.

75
00:12:54,598 --> 00:12:57,038
Eyvallah(thank you) brother Boran.

76
00:13:04,403 --> 00:13:09,123
They can come, but being Osman Bey's Alp
is not something easy.

77
00:13:11,572 --> 00:13:15,602
Novice people just slow us down,
Turan Alp.

78
00:13:19,592 --> 00:13:23,222
- Excuse me Master Davut.
- Eyvallah (okay) my valiant.

79
00:13:33,071 --> 00:13:36,501
- Excuse me too, Master Davut.
- Eyvallah my valiant.

80
00:13:48,860 --> 00:13:53,160
Davut Bey, did I do something wrong
to Goktug?

81
00:14:01,548 --> 00:14:03,378
Brother, you are doing wrong.

82
00:14:04,247 --> 00:14:08,227
You forgot too soon, Boran. A betrayer
came out of the refrugees recently.

83
00:14:08,227 --> 00:14:11,567
What do you expect me to do? Should I give
their men in Osman Bey's order right away?

84
00:14:11,919 --> 00:14:15,109
Do you think I don't care about Osman
Bey's security, brother?

85
00:14:16,842 --> 00:14:19,870
If you do, you need to be cautious.

86
00:14:19,870 --> 00:14:23,200
Brother, this shouldn't be an attitude
of Osman Bey's Alp.

87
00:14:23,559 --> 00:14:25,149
This is inappropriate.

88
00:14:28,062 --> 00:14:32,582
Goktug, stop being selfish.

89
00:14:34,030 --> 00:14:38,620
I have works to do.
You can go continue your chat with Turan.

90
00:15:10,326 --> 00:15:13,718
What is this all pomegranate thing?

91
00:15:13,718 --> 00:15:17,718
I saw pomegranate trees portrayed in...

92
00:15:18,128 --> 00:15:22,238
the both sides of the window in
the south wall of...

93
00:15:22,786 --> 00:15:26,070
Mevalana's shrine.

94
00:15:26,070 --> 00:15:31,110
It was also portrayed in the tombstone.

95
00:15:31,512 --> 00:15:33,972
Glazed china of Kubadabad.

96
00:15:35,756 --> 00:15:39,846
This is pomegranate branches you see
right here which symbolise...

97
00:15:40,336 --> 00:15:42,016
heaven and the eternal life.

98
00:15:42,748 --> 00:15:46,428
Pomegranate was mentioned in
Quran many times.

99
00:15:46,650 --> 00:15:48,800
It is the fruit of heaven.

100
00:15:49,233 --> 00:15:55,393
Pomegranate symbolises earth. The grains
in it symbolises people.

101
00:15:56,029 --> 00:16:01,329
The membrane among the grains
symbolises the differences among people.

102
00:16:01,691 --> 00:16:05,941
It shows that we are one even though
there are differences.

103
00:16:06,612 --> 00:16:12,412
In conclusion, pomegranate is the image
of eternal life and power.

104
00:16:13,707 --> 00:16:15,247
Power.

105
00:16:16,704 --> 00:16:18,024
Power.

106
00:16:20,444 --> 00:16:23,964
Turks and power.

107
00:16:46,359 --> 00:16:51,759
Your power is like this pomegranate
I squish in my hand...

108
00:16:52,016 --> 00:16:54,926
Sultan Mesut.

109
00:17:02,573 --> 00:17:06,673
Let's talk about the tax.

110
00:17:21,964 --> 00:17:24,884
My Sultan, we recieved a letter from
Osman Bey.

111
00:17:42,975 --> 00:17:45,825
Osman Bey will visit me.

112
00:17:47,948 --> 00:17:53,008
Governors stated they wouldn't
pay tax first.

113
00:17:53,347 --> 00:17:57,067
Now, Osman is coming.

114
00:17:57,467 --> 00:18:02,207
Let's see what's behind this.

115
00:18:03,651 --> 00:18:07,731
It was wise to end your hostility
with Osman Bey.

116
00:18:08,174 --> 00:18:12,444
Byzantine is behind this is you wonder.

117
00:18:13,245 --> 00:18:18,155
Byzantine can't oppose me.

118
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:24,430
I will support Osman Bey if he fights
against Byzantine.

119
00:18:26,349 --> 00:18:29,529
I have no doubt.

120
00:18:29,623 --> 00:18:35,893
Osman's worth is measured by his enemy.

121
00:18:52,616 --> 00:18:54,436
Ominous infidel!

122
00:18:55,395 --> 00:18:57,385
I apologize, my Sultan.

123
00:18:58,228 --> 00:19:02,638
We have more important issues
than this ominous man.

124
00:19:03,953 --> 00:19:09,443
I hear the footsteps of a huge war that
we will involve too.

125
00:19:20,090 --> 00:19:21,780
I'll give you a child.

126
00:19:23,081 --> 00:19:25,111
Thank Lord.

127
00:19:26,690 --> 00:19:28,390
Thank Lord.

128
00:19:30,956 --> 00:19:32,936
Can I come in Osman Bey?

129
00:19:33,310 --> 00:19:35,370
Come brother!

130
00:19:40,811 --> 00:19:42,827
I'll go to Konya tomorrow.

131
00:19:42,827 --> 00:19:45,877
I have to talk to Sultan
about the war.

132
00:19:46,633 --> 00:19:49,733
Now it's Nicola's turn after Togay,
inshallah. (if Allah permits.)

133
00:19:50,539 --> 00:19:54,349
I hope you bring good news from
Konya, Osman Bey.

134
00:19:54,780 --> 00:19:57,230
Inshallah brother,
inshallah(if Allah permits)

135
00:20:01,397 --> 00:20:05,844
Turanalp is excited.
He has news.

136
00:20:05,844 --> 00:20:10,324
- He is waiting for your permission.
- He shall not wait. Summon him.

137
00:20:11,649 --> 00:20:13,399
Turanalp!

138
00:20:20,862 --> 00:20:22,135
My Bey.

139
00:20:22,135 --> 00:20:25,944
Tell me what the important news is.

140
00:20:25,944 --> 00:20:30,974
I have Ghazi brothers who want to come
from Germiyan and fight by your side.

141
00:20:31,357 --> 00:20:33,747
They are waiting for your permission.

142
00:20:35,547 --> 00:20:37,417
Masha Allah (praise be)

143
00:20:38,892 --> 00:20:40,212
So, do you...

144
00:20:41,852 --> 00:20:43,972
vouch for them?

145
00:20:44,412 --> 00:20:48,672
Their swords are sharp, their hearts
are clean, their intention is good.

146
00:20:49,100 --> 00:20:51,842
They are living for war, they are
waiting for shahada.

147
00:20:51,842 --> 00:20:55,272
How holy is that!

148
00:20:55,608 --> 00:20:58,348
I have permission.
Let them come.

149
00:20:58,415 --> 00:21:01,255
- They shall join.
- We will not let you down my Bey.

150
00:21:02,269 --> 00:21:06,409
We shall not let you down,
you shall not either.

151
00:21:07,220 --> 00:21:11,260
May Allah gather us up in the war.

152
00:21:12,573 --> 00:21:14,063
Amin.

153
00:21:14,696 --> 00:21:16,356
Amin.

154
00:21:34,131 --> 00:21:36,241
We can't trust Osman.

155
00:21:36,274 --> 00:21:38,424
Sultan is supporting Osman.

156
00:21:38,929 --> 00:21:42,639
We'll take our steps according to this.

157
00:21:53,220 --> 00:21:58,130
Let Sultan think our hostility with
Osman ended.

158
00:21:58,559 --> 00:22:03,939
Is it time to pay him for abducting Togay
and seizing our gold?

159
00:22:07,927 --> 00:22:13,117
Do not doubt, Borucu.
do not doubt.

160
00:22:18,656 --> 00:22:22,316
Brother, take care of yourself in Konya.

161
00:22:22,594 --> 00:22:25,824
You can't know anyone in Konya.

162
00:22:26,065 --> 00:22:32,515
Vali Yargucu knows what happened to Togay
and his taxes are paid by Nicola.

163
00:22:34,650 --> 00:22:37,420
Don't worry, brother.

164
00:22:42,334 --> 00:22:45,734
Osman Bey, is there something you hide?

165
00:22:52,207 --> 00:22:54,087
What is that about brother?

166
00:22:54,838 --> 00:22:58,048
Are you excited for the upcoming war?

167
00:22:59,030 --> 00:23:01,000
I don't think so.

168
00:23:01,557 --> 00:23:04,607
Are you excited for the news
Turan Alp brought?

169
00:23:05,143 --> 00:23:07,103
I don't think so.

170
00:23:09,588 --> 00:23:11,308
There must be something else.

171
00:23:14,110 --> 00:23:16,460
What can I hide from you, brother?

172
00:23:20,764 --> 00:23:25,614
Osman Bey, you can hide, you can tell.

173
00:23:25,760 --> 00:23:31,390
It's up to you, but you can't convince
me to believe that there is nothing.

174
00:23:35,545 --> 00:23:39,705
So tell me...
What can...

175
00:23:40,653 --> 00:23:43,833
make your brother so happy?

176
00:23:44,536 --> 00:23:49,406
What can excite me more than the war?

177
00:23:52,662 --> 00:23:55,332
- Brother?
- Yes.

178
00:23:56,464 --> 00:23:59,284
Is my brother being a father?

179
00:23:59,985 --> 00:24:01,975
I will be a father!

180
00:24:04,592 --> 00:24:07,862
What a surprise!

181
00:24:08,121 --> 00:24:12,261
Congratulations, brother,
Congratulations.

182
00:24:12,936 --> 00:24:18,916
What are we waiting for, brother? Let's
notify everybody! Come here.

183
00:24:20,486 --> 00:24:24,427
We'll have a ceremony.
We'll have a ceremony right away.

184
00:24:24,427 --> 00:24:26,677
We'll feed the poors.

185
00:24:27,318 --> 00:24:30,028
Wait a second, brother.

186
00:24:30,855 --> 00:24:35,565
We need to be sure about my child's health
first. We can have a ceremony later.

187
00:24:36,860 --> 00:24:41,360
I'll go to Konya first. Then we can
do whatever you want!

188
00:24:43,881 --> 00:24:48,027
So, we'll hide. You are right, brother.

189
00:24:48,027 --> 00:24:49,527
We'll hide.

190
00:24:50,734 --> 00:24:53,899
How are we going to manage that, Osman?

191
00:24:53,899 --> 00:24:58,414
Ayse will understand, I know it.
However, I'll shut my mouth.

192
00:24:58,414 --> 00:25:02,394
I swear I'll shut my mouth brother.
Masha Allah (praise be).

193
00:25:03,726 --> 00:25:07,286
Okay then.
I will leave Osman Bey.

194
00:25:07,518 --> 00:25:11,968
I'll go now. Osman, I need to get out
of the tent, ride my horse.

195
00:25:12,342 --> 00:25:16,722
I cannot fit in here.
I am leaving Osman Bey.

196
00:25:16,725 --> 00:25:19,175
Take care of yourself.

197
00:25:25,227 --> 00:25:27,787
Another wolf-faced is coming, huh?

198
00:25:28,204 --> 00:25:29,614
Right.

199
00:25:30,922 --> 00:25:32,622
Mashallah (praise be)

200
00:25:33,581 --> 00:25:36,011
See you later.

201
00:26:10,891 --> 00:26:12,281
Bala.

202
00:26:14,604 --> 00:26:16,694
I'll go to Konya tomorrow.

203
00:26:18,161 --> 00:26:21,161
I have an important issue to talk to
Sultan.

204
00:26:24,175 --> 00:26:26,795
I want you to know something before
you leave.

205
00:26:29,017 --> 00:26:30,687
What is that?

206
00:26:37,569 --> 00:26:40,519
You don't have to hide your happiness,
my Osman.

207
00:26:45,169 --> 00:26:48,539
I know how happy you are to fulfill
your longing for a child...

208
00:26:48,925 --> 00:26:52,715
to do the bequest of Ertugrul Ghazi.

209
00:26:56,988 --> 00:26:59,338
I heard how happy your voice was...

210
00:27:00,942 --> 00:27:03,852
while talking to your brother Gunduz.

211
00:27:11,264 --> 00:27:15,424
My Bey, you are happy.
You deserved it.

212
00:27:15,823 --> 00:27:17,743
Do not hide it.

213
00:27:19,661 --> 00:27:20,531
Even more...

214
00:27:24,054 --> 00:27:26,194
involve me in this happiness.

215
00:27:30,959 --> 00:27:32,999
My Bala...

216
00:27:41,577 --> 00:27:44,717
Happiness without you is not
the real happiness for me.

217
00:28:00,640 --> 00:28:02,910
Just picked these.

218
00:28:03,774 --> 00:28:05,884
I chose the sweetest ones for you.

219
00:28:09,424 --> 00:28:11,514
Do you grow only apple?

220
00:28:11,810 --> 00:28:13,590
Yes, only apple.

221
00:28:17,090 --> 00:28:19,030
Do you wish anyting else.

222
00:28:21,885 --> 00:28:25,155
Do you know pomegranate.

223
00:28:25,384 --> 00:28:28,004
I know, of course.

224
00:28:28,093 --> 00:28:29,703
But I don't grow it in my garden.

225
00:28:31,538 --> 00:28:33,548
Can you find any?

226
00:28:36,162 --> 00:28:40,342
It is a winter fruit, Malhun Hatun?
You can't find it in summer.

227
00:28:42,515 --> 00:28:46,935
Yes, true. It would be awesome
if we had some though.

228
00:28:47,890 --> 00:28:52,280
Take a good care of Malhun Hatun
from now on. Do not let her work.

229
00:28:52,590 --> 00:28:56,760
Do not upset her.

230
00:29:00,557 --> 00:29:02,907
I'll try to find.

231
00:29:04,535 --> 00:29:06,195
It's going to be hard.

232
00:29:06,994 --> 00:29:10,354
Just check.
Maybe somebody brought it to Sogut.

233
00:29:12,843 --> 00:29:15,093
I'll check it.

234
00:29:34,992 --> 00:29:36,882
Welcome my Bey.

235
00:29:37,028 --> 00:29:38,268
Malhun Hatun.

236
00:29:39,229 --> 00:29:43,019
My travel is to Konya.

237
00:29:43,653 --> 00:29:47,073
But my mind is here.

238
00:29:48,892 --> 00:29:50,742
I wanted you to know.

239
00:29:50,896 --> 00:29:54,836
Take your mind with you, Osman Bey.
You shall leave your heart here.

240
00:29:56,797 --> 00:29:58,687
I can't sleep.

241
00:29:59,194 --> 00:30:02,394
My heart is bumping so strong that
it'll thurst through my breast.

242
00:30:04,059 --> 00:30:08,819
Both my mind and heart is here
with my child.

243
00:30:12,875 --> 00:30:16,695
You shall leave, Osman Bey.
Do not worry about us.

244
00:30:17,099 --> 00:30:21,279
I'll protect my body until that
glorious day comes and...

245
00:30:21,763 --> 00:30:24,673
you hold your baby.

246
00:30:26,781 --> 00:30:29,601
I will remember I carry two lives
in one body.

247
00:30:36,281 --> 00:30:38,441
May Allah bless you.

248
00:30:41,846 --> 00:30:43,706
Osman Bey.

249
00:30:48,378 --> 00:30:51,298
We'll wait for your return with
our child.

250
00:30:54,101 --> 00:30:56,131
Mashallah (praise be).

251
00:31:00,643 --> 00:31:02,593
Mashallah (praise be).

252
00:31:32,198 --> 00:31:34,358
Kill them!

253
00:32:08,366 --> 00:32:12,266
He is not Turk, idiot!
Commander Ducas.

254
00:32:15,715 --> 00:32:18,575
He came in advance to examine.

255
00:32:19,656 --> 00:32:21,056
What I understand is...

256
00:32:21,509 --> 00:32:23,719
we don't need enemy...

257
00:32:24,175 --> 00:32:26,175
while you are here.

258
00:32:33,454 --> 00:32:35,524
Forgive us, Commander Ducas.

259
00:32:37,409 --> 00:32:42,069
I now understand better how Nicola's
soldiers were...

260
00:32:42,295 --> 00:32:46,535
slaughtered by Osman like pigs!

261
00:32:55,872 --> 00:33:00,442
Do not forget we are here to cover
Nicola's faults...

262
00:33:01,080 --> 00:33:06,560
not to only clear Turks in Bitinya.

263
00:33:09,698 --> 00:33:12,198
Our mission is not easy.

264
00:33:26,225 --> 00:33:28,355
I am here to congratulate.

265
00:33:28,410 --> 00:33:31,020
Welcome.
Here...

266
00:33:49,823 --> 00:33:51,613
Thank you.

267
00:33:56,991 --> 00:33:59,861
Your visit made me happy.

268
00:34:01,363 --> 00:34:03,413
We have a good news.

269
00:34:04,075 --> 00:34:07,045
We have been waiting for it.

270
00:34:11,111 --> 00:34:13,541
May Allah bless you.

271
00:34:15,655 --> 00:34:17,825
You satisfied us.

272
00:34:24,040 --> 00:34:28,290
We'll wait for a while, then
we'll notify the tribe inshallah.

273
00:34:31,046 --> 00:34:32,676
Inshallah (if Allah permits).

274
00:34:43,468 --> 00:34:46,348
- Take it.
- Thank you.

275
00:35:03,340 --> 00:35:05,490
Bala Hatun.

276
00:35:08,191 --> 00:35:10,211
These socks are beautiful!

277
00:35:12,653 --> 00:35:14,693
I am very happy to take them.

278
00:35:17,632 --> 00:35:22,662
I stitched them myself for our
child with Osman Bey.

279
00:35:29,820 --> 00:35:31,090
However...

280
00:35:33,381 --> 00:35:35,951
They were destined for your child.

281
00:36:00,323 --> 00:36:02,743
And you are giving them to me now?

282
00:36:08,595 --> 00:36:12,925
I'll be happy if you clothe your child
with these.

283
00:36:22,709 --> 00:36:25,379
After all, it's my Osman's child.

284
00:36:28,691 --> 00:36:30,091
Also...

285
00:36:32,052 --> 00:36:34,362
I will be a kind of mother.

286
00:36:44,625 --> 00:36:46,795
Of course you will be.

287
00:36:47,237 --> 00:36:49,187
Of course you will be.

288
00:36:52,004 --> 00:36:53,954
You will be.

289
00:37:00,185 --> 00:37:02,975
If this is going to relieve you a bit...

290
00:37:03,405 --> 00:37:05,550
Of course you are going to be...

291
00:37:05,550 --> 00:37:07,330
like a mother.

292
00:37:10,581 --> 00:37:12,361
Thank you.

293
00:37:12,965 --> 00:37:14,505
Thank you.

294
00:37:21,256 --> 00:37:22,956
I'll leave.

295
00:37:31,830 --> 00:37:34,450
I wish we met in another way.

296
00:37:34,920 --> 00:37:37,260
We could have been a good couple.

297
00:37:38,475 --> 00:37:41,135
But we didn't.

298
00:37:45,932 --> 00:37:48,302
This is our destiny.

299
00:38:45,117 --> 00:38:47,127
Welcome Ducas.

300
00:38:48,816 --> 00:38:51,306
The unfailing warrior of Ceasar...

301
00:38:51,377 --> 00:38:52,977
Nicola.

302
00:38:57,464 --> 00:38:59,274
Ceaser it was, right?

303
00:39:11,302 --> 00:39:17,312
You were a fan of his wars when
you were young.

304
00:39:19,416 --> 00:39:22,506
Great leader, great commander.

305
00:39:23,846 --> 00:39:27,016
I always respected your memory,
Ducas.

306
00:39:28,670 --> 00:39:32,150
There is no Ceaser in the battlefield.

307
00:39:33,156 --> 00:39:34,926
We are.

308
00:39:43,232 --> 00:39:44,832
Are we?

309
00:39:45,680 --> 00:39:48,320
I damaged Turks a lot, Ducas.

310
00:39:48,873 --> 00:39:51,343
I stopped their grow.

311
00:39:51,584 --> 00:39:54,954
Now it is time to get rid of them.

312
00:40:00,352 --> 00:40:04,542
I don't have time for empty talk, Nciola.

313
00:40:07,518 --> 00:40:09,988
Start working now.

314
00:40:30,350 --> 00:40:34,250
We'll go to food house to welcome the
families coming from Germiyan.

315
00:40:35,480 --> 00:40:39,490
I'll join you when I'm done with this.
I want to participate in this charity.

316
00:40:39,754 --> 00:40:43,384
One must not run away from charity,
Ayse Hatun. Thank you.

317
00:40:43,446 --> 00:40:44,766
Well said.

318
00:40:50,901 --> 00:40:53,151
- Have a nice day.
- Thank you Zoe.

319
00:41:03,128 --> 00:41:05,008
Why are you staring?

320
00:41:05,238 --> 00:41:09,178
I am looking at the Osman Bey's hatun
who washed the clothes.

321
00:41:11,493 --> 00:41:15,423
These are Osman Bey's. I can't
let anyone else do it.

322
00:41:19,446 --> 00:41:21,416
Where are you going?

323
00:41:21,447 --> 00:41:24,947
I need to go Sogut, Bala Hatun.

324
00:41:27,032 --> 00:41:28,802
I need to visit the woofer.

325
00:41:29,572 --> 00:41:32,622
Okay then, go.

326
00:41:32,718 --> 00:41:34,758
Have a nice day.

327
00:42:10,243 --> 00:42:15,213
We believe you won't disrespect our Sultan,
Osman Bey.

328
00:42:18,360 --> 00:42:23,110
Our Sultan deserves respect not because
of your words...

329
00:42:23,930 --> 00:42:28,110
but because of his good intentions.

330
00:42:30,326 --> 00:42:33,036
Don't worry, Perdadar Efendi (Bey).

331
00:42:34,408 --> 00:42:35,938
Here you go.

332
00:42:36,162 --> 00:42:37,562
The doors!

333
00:42:46,468 --> 00:42:50,658
Kayı Bey Ertugrul Ghazi's son Osman Bey.

334
00:43:10,826 --> 00:43:14,596
- Welcome, Osman Bey.
- Thank you my Sultan.

335
00:43:22,129 --> 00:43:27,159
You got rid of Togay thanks to the
information I gave you.

336
00:43:27,256 --> 00:43:29,066
Thanks to you...

337
00:43:30,042 --> 00:43:35,552
I dealt with not only Togay,
but also Byzantine's game.

338
00:43:45,857 --> 00:43:51,187
According to the information I recieved,
they'll attack us with a...

339
00:43:52,175 --> 00:43:55,605
huge army under Emperor's order.

340
00:43:56,126 --> 00:43:58,046
I thought so.

341
00:43:58,289 --> 00:44:00,619
Emperor send a messenger.

342
00:44:01,100 --> 00:44:06,040
His governors rejected paying
tax to Seljuqs.

343
00:44:09,888 --> 00:44:16,378
A Macedonian commander will be
leading the army. His name is Dukas.

344
00:44:16,954 --> 00:44:22,244
Dukas.
He destroyed my army earlier.

345
00:44:23,601 --> 00:44:25,871
He is dangerous and brave.

346
00:44:26,664 --> 00:44:30,494
He hates Turks more than Mongols.

347
00:44:30,748 --> 00:44:33,188
What is the source of your
information, Osman Bey?

348
00:44:36,293 --> 00:44:37,893
My Sultan.

349
00:44:40,491 --> 00:44:45,371
The walls of the palace are thin, I heard.

350
00:44:46,696 --> 00:44:49,906
You can trust my source.

351
00:44:51,143 --> 00:44:55,763
Then, Byzantine aims Seljuqs...

352
00:44:56,873 --> 00:44:58,483
not you.

353
00:45:00,844 --> 00:45:02,704
They aim me.

354
00:45:03,913 --> 00:45:06,663
My army will be ready.

355
00:45:08,754 --> 00:45:12,054
I'll be leading my army.

356
00:45:13,055 --> 00:45:16,515
You shall get ready for the war
with your Ghazis.

357
00:45:16,639 --> 00:45:21,419
My Sultan, we don't need to get
ready for war. We already are.

358
00:45:25,059 --> 00:45:28,699
May Allah help you all, Osman Bey.

359
00:45:31,075 --> 00:45:32,365
My Sultan.

360
00:45:57,166 --> 00:45:58,576
- My Bey.
- Let's go.

361
00:46:18,853 --> 00:46:20,723
Are the soldiers ready?

362
00:46:21,701 --> 00:46:26,801
The best, the most savage ones
are ready, Vali Yargucu.

363
00:46:26,960 --> 00:46:28,160
Nice.

364
00:46:34,872 --> 00:46:39,012
So, does this Osman have no flaw?

365
00:46:40,065 --> 00:46:41,535
He does.

366
00:46:41,576 --> 00:46:43,756
He has a big flaw.

367
00:46:47,744 --> 00:46:49,964
Osman is in love.

368
00:46:50,117 --> 00:46:51,587
In love?

369
00:46:51,775 --> 00:46:53,355
With whom?

370
00:46:53,630 --> 00:46:57,830
With his wife.
With Bala.

371
00:47:00,696 --> 00:47:04,616
How can it be a flaw that a man
is in love with his wife, Nicola?

372
00:47:04,918 --> 00:47:07,068
What can we do with this info?

373
00:47:07,769 --> 00:47:10,329
Bala can't give birth.

374
00:47:10,455 --> 00:47:13,755
Osman didn't want to marry anyone
else despite of this fact.

375
00:47:13,791 --> 00:47:16,581
This shows he has a flaw.

376
00:47:18,718 --> 00:47:22,978
He got rid of his flaw
by marrying Malhun Hatun.

377
00:47:24,246 --> 00:47:27,976
Fortunately, I made my move to see
his other flaws.

378
00:47:28,071 --> 00:47:31,131
I'll introduce you to my spy
in Kayı Tribe.

379
00:47:31,266 --> 00:47:32,796
Doors!

380
00:47:46,026 --> 00:47:47,726
Zoe.

381
00:47:50,468 --> 00:47:52,388
Commander Dukas.

382
00:47:55,803 --> 00:47:58,563
My spy in Kayı tribe.

383
00:47:59,113 --> 00:48:03,203
So you managed to get in Kayı
tribe.

384
00:48:07,575 --> 00:48:11,165
You brought important news with
you after your absence...

385
00:48:11,230 --> 00:48:13,390
right Zoe?

386
00:48:13,568 --> 00:48:15,808
I have a crucial news for you.

387
00:48:17,648 --> 00:48:20,528
Osman Bey's Hatun
Malhun Hatun...

388
00:48:21,290 --> 00:48:22,910
is pregnant.

389
00:48:30,443 --> 00:48:32,003
Zoe.

390
00:48:33,885 --> 00:48:37,275
You are close to Malhun Hatun, right?

391
00:48:37,715 --> 00:48:39,865
I am her servant.

392
00:48:49,407 --> 00:48:52,567
While our armies crush Osman's alps...

393
00:48:52,711 --> 00:48:56,061
Kayı tribe will recieve a bad news.

394
00:48:58,429 --> 00:49:02,059
Zoe.
Go.

395
00:49:02,563 --> 00:49:06,703
Do what you need to do.

396
00:49:39,297 --> 00:49:41,097
Gunduz Bey is approaching!

397
00:49:49,072 --> 00:49:51,946
Welcome to Kayı tent, valiants!

398
00:49:51,946 --> 00:49:53,626
Thank you my Bey!

399
00:49:54,316 --> 00:49:57,648
Mashallah (praise be).

400
00:49:58,508 --> 00:50:00,408
Mashallah (praise be).

401
00:50:02,727 --> 00:50:05,607
- Sheik Edebali is approaching!
- Sheik Edebali is coming.

402
00:50:16,287 --> 00:50:20,417
- Welcome valiants.
- Thank you my Sheik.

403
00:50:23,991 --> 00:50:27,131
Akca, take them to food house.

404
00:50:27,372 --> 00:50:29,942
Let them eat.

405
00:50:30,083 --> 00:50:32,613
Bala Hatun is ready there, my Sheik.

406
00:50:32,784 --> 00:50:35,634
We are ready.
Our boilers are boiling.

407
00:50:36,699 --> 00:50:39,329
We can take them right now, my Sheik.

408
00:50:44,997 --> 00:50:49,537
Welcome, you brought us goodness.

409
00:50:51,573 --> 00:50:54,593
You are welcomed here.

410
00:50:55,322 --> 00:50:59,782
It is a honor to host you.

411
00:51:05,642 --> 00:51:09,684
My Sheik, we heard Kayı Hatuns are
fighters too.

412
00:51:09,911 --> 00:51:13,813
Bala Hatun, Gonca Hatun, Aygül Hatun.
We heard of them.

413
00:51:13,813 --> 00:51:16,233
We want to fight too.

414
00:51:18,924 --> 00:51:22,024
What do you say, Gündüz Bey?

415
00:51:22,685 --> 00:51:26,265
Male lion and female lion are
the same, they are one, my Sheik.

416
00:51:29,694 --> 00:51:33,634
We are all sons and daughters of
Oghuz Khan. We love to fight!

417
00:51:41,300 --> 00:51:43,900
I am hungry, uncle.

418
00:51:49,826 --> 00:51:52,166
Mashallah (praise be)

419
00:51:56,051 --> 00:51:57,781
Come here, my valiant.

420
00:52:01,037 --> 00:52:05,567
Let's go!
What are you waiting for?

421
00:52:21,857 --> 00:52:26,437
Alps! Here is the community of Kayi.

422
00:52:27,173 --> 00:52:30,373
Here is the case we are going
to die for.

423
00:52:34,435 --> 00:52:36,165
Let's go.

424
00:53:10,614 --> 00:53:12,184
Goktug.

425
00:53:15,308 --> 00:53:17,208
I don't want it, thanks.

426
00:53:18,411 --> 00:53:20,941
Goktug, don't push it. Come on brother.

427
00:53:46,979 --> 00:53:49,039
Goktug.

428
00:53:49,574 --> 00:53:51,974
- Come here.
- Yes my bey.

429
00:53:54,954 --> 00:53:56,861
What is the problem...

430
00:53:58,462 --> 00:54:00,522
between you and Boran?

431
00:54:01,329 --> 00:54:03,715
What happened when I was at palace?

432
00:54:03,715 --> 00:54:05,335
Tell me.

433
00:54:07,206 --> 00:54:09,226
Saltug Alp is coming!

434
00:54:25,650 --> 00:54:29,000
My Bey, it's Mongols.
They are crowded.

435
00:54:31,098 --> 00:54:32,798
Alps!

436
00:54:33,285 --> 00:54:35,615
Relax.

437
00:54:37,512 --> 00:54:40,302
But be cautious too.

438
00:54:44,487 --> 00:54:46,827
- Goktug.
- Yes my Bey.

439
00:54:47,107 --> 00:54:49,763
Let them come.

440
00:54:49,871 --> 00:54:52,091
- Boran.
- Yes my Bey.

441
00:54:53,058 --> 00:54:55,368
- You know what to do.
- I do, my Bey.

442
00:54:56,101 --> 00:54:57,611
Okay.

443
00:54:57,611 --> 00:55:01,291
Aykurt, Saltug.
Let's go Alps!

444
00:55:02,693 --> 00:55:04,383
Alps!

445
00:55:08,068 --> 00:55:11,308
Wait for my sign. We'll wait for them
to come. Be careful.

446
00:55:11,924 --> 00:55:13,414
Come on.

447
00:56:02,529 --> 00:56:04,839
Did Yargucu send you_

448
00:56:05,139 --> 00:56:07,279
Get up and kneel!

449
00:56:09,618 --> 00:56:11,718
What did Yargucu say?

450
00:56:12,135 --> 00:56:17,075
Did he told you to ask me to kneel,
that I'd accept it?

451
00:56:23,322 --> 00:56:25,312
I said kneel!

452
00:56:29,824 --> 00:56:32,174
If you came here to make me kneel.

453
00:56:34,696 --> 00:56:36,086
Then...

454
00:56:37,971 --> 00:56:41,061
Watch out for your knees.

455
00:56:46,853 --> 00:56:48,963
Kill them all!

456
00:59:38,935 --> 00:59:40,595
Goktug.

457
00:59:52,012 --> 00:59:54,972
- You are late, brother.
- No offense, brother.

458
00:59:55,053 --> 00:59:56,943
I'll be quicker next time.

459
00:59:57,459 --> 01:00:00,239
- Eyvallah Eyvallah (thank you)
- Keep on!

460
01:00:41,988 --> 01:00:45,158
Osman Bey, forgive my life.

461
01:00:47,099 --> 01:00:48,959
Forgive my life.

462
01:00:49,546 --> 01:00:53,016
Not you, not Yargucu...

463
01:00:54,530 --> 01:00:56,890
Even Geyhatu came...

464
01:00:57,817 --> 01:01:00,317
Even Genghis Khan got out of
his tomb and came here...

465
01:01:02,087 --> 01:01:05,207
Nobody could make me kneel.

466
01:01:10,678 --> 01:01:13,348
You'll fail Osman.

467
01:01:13,572 --> 01:01:15,122
You'll fail.

468
01:01:15,341 --> 01:01:19,811
Ertugrul Ghazi's son Osman Bey
has always a plan.

469
01:01:20,696 --> 01:01:26,266
However, the real plan is Allah's plan.

470
01:01:28,015 --> 01:01:32,145
From now on, I shall not postpone
Allah's plan for you.

471
01:01:33,297 --> 01:01:36,677
Dark Osman shall perform.

472
01:01:54,406 --> 01:01:56,956
My Bey, what did these dogs want from us?

473
01:01:58,441 --> 01:02:02,761
Our rebellion offended Yargucu.

474
01:02:06,809 --> 01:02:10,759
Tell me, what is going on between you?

475
01:02:18,374 --> 01:02:23,504
I was a bit frustrated, but my valiant
brother made it all right.

476
01:02:37,182 --> 01:02:39,312
My brother.

477
01:02:40,189 --> 01:02:42,579
- My Goktug.
- Mashallah (praise be).

478
01:02:49,005 --> 01:02:51,365
A valiant does not get hurt
by enemy's sword.

479
01:02:56,493 --> 01:02:58,813
He gets hurt by his
friend's smack.

480
01:02:58,870 --> 01:03:02,490
Eyvallah my Bey,
I am happy to...

481
01:03:03,098 --> 01:03:05,628
make everything like they
were used to be.

482
01:03:09,465 --> 01:03:12,795
See the roots of a tree to check
if it's good...

483
01:03:12,795 --> 01:03:16,145
hear a valiant's words to check
if he's good.

484
01:03:16,145 --> 01:03:19,555
Praise you together!

485
01:03:20,156 --> 01:03:21,666
Eyvallah (thank you) my Bey.

486
01:03:25,532 --> 01:03:28,882
Gather up Alps!
We are going to the tribe.

487
01:03:29,285 --> 01:03:33,455
It's time to destroy the
enemy with Turk's smack!

488
01:03:33,497 --> 01:03:35,127
Let's go!

489
01:03:48,164 --> 01:03:52,024
- May Allah Bless you.
- May Allah bless you.

490
01:03:54,129 --> 01:03:57,159
Can you add more? I'll take it to my
children.

491
01:03:58,017 --> 01:04:02,187
Not only Ghazis, but also their families
are coming now, Bala Hatun.

492
01:04:03,150 --> 01:04:07,261
Sogut will be crowded. The comers will
be fruitful I hope.

493
01:04:07,261 --> 01:04:09,001
I hope so.

494
01:04:09,673 --> 01:04:14,783
Bala, we are at ease now.
I'll go to the woofer if you excuse me.

495
01:04:15,032 --> 01:04:18,125
Of course Gonca.
We'll handle the rest.

496
01:04:18,125 --> 01:04:20,195
Thank you.

497
01:04:21,074 --> 01:04:22,604
Enjoy your mela.

498
01:04:28,378 --> 01:04:31,488
Look how beautiful she is, Ayse Hatun!

499
01:04:31,488 --> 01:04:34,338
Mashallah (praise be)
She is a beauty.

500
01:04:34,679 --> 01:04:36,909
- Thank you.
- Masha Allah (praise be).

501
01:04:37,417 --> 01:04:40,087
You are the beauty, Bala Hatun.

502
01:04:40,403 --> 01:04:43,423
We've alwasy wondered who Osman
Bey's Hatun is.

503
01:04:43,945 --> 01:04:46,185
Mashallah. You are beautiful.

504
01:04:46,801 --> 01:04:48,621
Thank you.

505
01:04:57,868 --> 01:05:00,780
I've heard that
Ghazi's came from Germiyan.

506
01:05:00,780 --> 01:05:01,227
-I wanted to see if I can help.
-Welcome, Malhun Hatun.
I've heard that
Ghazi's came from Germiyan.

507
01:05:01,227 --> 01:05:05,910
-I wanted to see if I can help.
-Welcome, Malhun Hatun.

508
01:05:06,187 --> 01:05:09,727
Welcome. Come.

509
01:05:23,050 --> 01:05:28,060
You look curious.
Let me help you.

510
01:05:29,320 --> 01:05:33,320
I'm Kızılbeyoğlu Umur Bey's
daughter...

511
01:05:33,320 --> 01:05:37,320
Osman Bey's wife, Malhun Hatun.

512
01:05:47,067 --> 01:05:51,067
Osman Bey is very lucky.

513
01:05:51,067 --> 01:05:55,547
Come to me when you are in need.

514
01:05:55,547 --> 01:05:58,577
Thank you.
Thank you.

515
01:06:10,829 --> 01:06:13,479
Allah bless you.

516
01:06:33,766 --> 01:06:37,066
-Good day.
-Welcome, Gonca Hatun.

517
01:06:37,066 --> 01:06:41,066
-Thank you. Are the fabric here?
-Yes.

518
01:06:47,861 --> 01:06:50,071
Thank you.

519
01:06:52,842 --> 01:06:57,722
Are you pleased with the fabric
I provided for the wedding?

520
01:07:00,811 --> 01:07:05,061
Zoey would come here today.
She is Malhun Hatun's helper.

521
01:07:05,061 --> 01:07:07,731
You should've asked her instead.

522
01:07:10,404 --> 01:07:15,024
-Did she not come?
-I was here the whole day.

523
01:07:15,024 --> 01:07:18,544
She didn't come.

524
01:07:25,499 --> 01:07:36,466
Oh, bully... Oh, bully... Come and get me.

525
01:07:41,526 --> 01:07:45,016
Ah, boys...

526
01:07:56,565 --> 01:08:01,705
Who are you?
What do you want from me?

527
01:08:05,915 --> 01:08:09,105
Boys, right?

528
01:08:10,646 --> 01:08:13,856
Even a hoar like you talk of them.

529
01:08:13,856 --> 01:08:18,646
What do you want from me, I said!
You sneaked in like a snake!

530
01:08:18,646 --> 01:08:23,646
Cut it short, hoar.
I came for a cure.

531
01:08:23,646 --> 01:08:28,916
-What cure?
-There is a woman burdened by a bully.

532
01:08:28,916 --> 01:08:32,996
I want to take off her burden.

533
01:08:36,714 --> 01:08:40,714
I want to take it off in a way that...

534
01:08:40,714 --> 01:08:44,054
neither she nor her husband
will know it.

535
01:08:44,054 --> 01:08:48,054
What are you saying?
Leave here!

536
01:08:48,436 --> 01:08:52,876
-I don't want anyone to get suspicious.
-Get out, I say!

537
01:08:52,876 --> 01:08:57,176
It shouldn't happen as soon as
she drinks the poison.

538
01:08:58,550 --> 01:09:02,550
It should kill the child
in her belly.

539
01:09:02,550 --> 01:09:06,970
I want her to rot while she crawls
from the loss of her child.

540
01:09:09,308 --> 01:09:12,008
Do you understand?

541
01:09:18,631 --> 01:09:22,631
And I brought you Nikola's regards.

542
01:09:24,390 --> 01:09:29,690
-Why didn't you say before?
-I wanted to see if you are quiet.

543
01:09:38,864 --> 01:09:42,864
I'm quiet as a mute.

544
01:09:42,864 --> 01:09:46,864
And my venom is deadlier
than a snake. But...

545
01:09:46,864 --> 01:09:51,684
-But what?
-You need to wait for that poison.

546
01:09:53,018 --> 01:09:59,618
It should wait like wine for her
to enjoy it.

547
01:10:39,284 --> 01:10:43,284
Eat, my lions, eat.
You fought well.

548
01:10:43,284 --> 01:10:47,284
We beat them well.

549
01:10:47,284 --> 01:10:51,284
Cerkutay, fill your stomach.
The great battle is soon.

550
01:10:53,297 --> 01:10:58,147
The sultan promised Osman Bey.
He will send an army.

551
01:11:04,981 --> 01:11:09,321
Cerkutay, what are you thinking?

552
01:11:12,360 --> 01:11:17,390
The great battle will have
great spoils.

553
01:11:20,571 --> 01:11:27,211
Cerkutay, were you this interested
in the spoils?

554
01:11:28,306 --> 01:11:32,866
Without spoils, there is no dowry.

555
01:11:33,530 --> 01:11:37,530
Without dowry, there is no wedding.

556
01:11:38,143 --> 01:11:42,143
Without wedding, it's no good.

557
01:11:44,016 --> 01:11:50,066
Without battle, there are no spoils.
What would you do without the battle?

558
01:11:51,669 --> 01:11:55,669
It would be easier for
the old Cerkutay.

559
01:11:56,542 --> 01:12:02,172
But nevermind, let's not talk about
the old Cerkutay in Bamsı Bey's tent.

560
01:12:04,507 --> 01:12:09,287
Allah will feed everyone.

561
01:12:11,351 --> 01:12:18,961
Indeed, indeed. But without battle,
you would never marry.

562
01:12:19,674 --> 01:12:22,534
Boran Alp is married.

563
01:12:23,466 --> 01:12:28,306
What about you?
How will you marry Zoey?

564
01:12:31,013 --> 01:12:36,063
Zoey? What Zoey?

565
01:12:43,536 --> 01:12:47,866
Listen to me, save some money.

566
01:12:48,346 --> 01:12:52,346
Weddings are expensive.

567
01:12:55,736 --> 01:12:58,326
Yeah.

568
01:13:44,628 --> 01:13:48,628
-Bala.
-My bey.

569
01:13:52,922 --> 01:13:57,822
What were you doing? Tell me.
What did you do at Söğüt?

570
01:13:57,822 --> 01:14:02,722
-Was the food enough for the hungry?
-Thank Allah, it was enough.

571
01:14:02,722 --> 01:14:07,942
-Everyone is taken care of.
-Mashallah. Mashallah.

572
01:14:10,613 --> 01:14:16,293
Now, you are getting more jobs and
more burden.

573
01:14:17,508 --> 01:14:22,138
Thank Malhun Hatun.
She came there too.

574
01:14:23,426 --> 01:14:25,776
What did she do?

575
01:14:30,005 --> 01:14:35,265
-She came to Söğüt?
-She introduced herself to the people.

576
01:14:38,801 --> 01:14:42,801
Then, she handed out food
with us.

577
01:14:57,915 --> 01:15:02,415
The table is ready, my bey.
I cooked the food you like.

578
01:15:09,324 --> 01:15:13,324
Thank you, Bala. Thank you.

579
01:15:14,645 --> 01:15:20,265
I should check Malhun Hatun.
Then, I'll come and we'll eat.

580
01:15:21,570 --> 01:15:24,890
As you want, my bey.

581
01:15:51,741 --> 01:15:55,741
-Welcome, Osman Bey.
-Malhun Hatun?

582
01:15:58,556 --> 01:16:02,556
-You made preparation.
-I have.

583
01:16:02,928 --> 01:16:09,238
I told you. You'll always see a smiling
face and a table at the ready.

584
01:16:09,911 --> 01:16:15,181
-I told you to not tire yourself.
-I didn't mount a horse and went to battle.

585
01:16:15,181 --> 01:16:19,181
It's just a table. Come.

586
01:16:22,239 --> 01:16:27,239
I'm not hungry. I came to ask
if you are alright.

587
01:16:27,834 --> 01:16:31,024
Will you stay that short?

588
01:16:33,759 --> 01:16:36,869
If you are alright--

589
01:16:48,076 --> 01:16:51,656
You don't want me to leave, right?

590
01:16:54,127 --> 01:16:58,727
Don't feel forced, Osman Bey.
I can eat alone.

591
01:17:03,573 --> 01:17:07,573
Are you alright?

592
01:17:09,090 --> 01:17:12,760
Come and sit.
Sit here.

593
01:17:12,760 --> 01:17:16,270
I'm alright, Osman Bey.
I'm alright. Don't worry.

594
01:17:21,795 --> 01:17:25,795
Malhun Hatun, why are you making
preparations like this?

595
01:17:26,079 --> 01:17:30,079
Let Alaca Hatun do it from now on.

596
01:17:32,114 --> 01:17:35,414
Drink this now.

597
01:17:35,414 --> 01:17:40,914
You are right, Osman Bey. I should
be more careful.

598
01:17:50,516 --> 01:17:55,366
-Are you any better?
-I'm alright, Osman Bey.

599
01:18:12,313 --> 01:18:17,213
Now, I'm not going anywhere.

600
01:18:18,484 --> 01:18:23,224
I'm here, with you.

601
01:18:23,224 --> 01:18:28,304
Don't tire yourself and
don't make yourself sad.

602
01:18:31,591 --> 01:18:37,001
Come on. Come on, eat.

603
01:18:38,534 --> 01:18:42,534
With the name of Allah.

604
01:18:43,794 --> 01:18:46,314
Go on, come on.

605
01:18:46,687 --> 01:18:50,687
Eat, eat, come on.

606
01:19:58,085 --> 01:20:01,605
With the name of Allah.

607
01:20:18,131 --> 01:20:21,561
May it be easy, Gonca Hatun.

608
01:20:21,561 --> 01:20:26,031
Have you done your shopping
at Söğüt?

609
01:20:28,968 --> 01:20:34,068
All the fabric was so good. I found
everything I was looking for.

610
01:20:34,068 --> 01:20:37,498
Good.

611
01:20:58,716 --> 01:21:03,746
What's wrong, Gonca?
Why are you worried?

612
01:21:05,517 --> 01:21:10,557
I've talked to Zoey. She told me that
she bought fabric from Söğüt.

613
01:21:10,557 --> 01:21:16,587
-So, what's wrong with that?
-Bala, I was there too.

614
01:21:16,831 --> 01:21:20,831
Zoey never went there.

615
01:21:21,958 --> 01:21:25,408
She must be doing something.

616
01:21:29,878 --> 01:21:34,688
I think it's better if you talk to
Malhun Hatun about this.

617
01:21:34,688 --> 01:21:38,238
Let's not accuse her now.

618
01:21:41,313 --> 01:21:47,023
Maybe it has an explanation.
Also, Malhun Hatun might misunderstand it.

619
01:21:48,511 --> 01:21:54,551
She might think that we don't
want her in the tribe.

620
01:21:54,551 --> 01:21:57,701
What will we do, then?

621
01:22:00,755 --> 01:22:06,975
Keep your eyes on her.
When we make sure...

622
01:22:06,989 --> 01:22:11,709
-I'll talk to Malhun Hatun.
-As you wish, Bala.

623
01:22:17,930 --> 01:22:21,930
-May it be easy.
-Thank you.

624
01:22:27,643 --> 01:22:33,223
A momento from Kutamışoğlu Süleyman
Shah.

625
01:22:34,654 --> 01:22:37,554
Osman Bey deserves it.

626
01:22:49,969 --> 01:22:53,359
Mashallah.

627
01:23:03,571 --> 01:23:07,571
When the order came from
Constantinople...

628
01:23:08,731 --> 01:23:11,831
all the lords united...

629
01:23:13,130 --> 01:23:17,510
and Sultan Mesud made his
decision.

630
01:23:17,653 --> 01:23:22,833
He thought that all the preperations
were against him.

631
01:23:23,107 --> 01:23:29,067
And for this reason, he'll come personally
with his army.

632
01:23:32,409 --> 01:23:36,409
Sultan Mesud will come personally, huh?

633
01:23:37,952 --> 01:23:45,122
Sultan Mesud wants you to stand with
us in this battle.

634
01:23:45,576 --> 01:23:50,066
This is a matter of life and death,
Osman Bey.

635
01:23:50,066 --> 01:23:54,066
When will we stand with you
if not today?

636
01:23:54,066 --> 01:23:59,936
Our sultan will come from Konya and
we'll stay idle? Is that possible?

637
01:24:00,066 --> 01:24:05,386
Of course not! All Turkmen beys
love jihad!

638
01:24:05,386 --> 01:24:11,416
When the swords start to strike
the shields...

639
01:24:11,416 --> 01:24:15,576
they can't keep anyone in their tents.

640
01:24:23,499 --> 01:24:27,499
Yarhisar, Bilecik...

641
01:24:28,354 --> 01:24:32,554
İnegöl, Söğüt...

642
01:24:33,444 --> 01:24:38,564
Firstly, we need to protect that line.

643
01:24:38,564 --> 01:24:42,564
-This line will be bolstered, sir.
-If Turks...

644
01:24:42,564 --> 01:24:46,564
pass this line...

645
01:24:46,945 --> 01:24:52,415
their next target will be the heart of
Bhytinia, İznik.

646
01:24:53,859 --> 01:24:59,609
We won't let them have this dream.

647
01:25:00,740 --> 01:25:06,050
I'm listening, Commander Dukas.

648
01:25:08,102 --> 01:25:12,622
After forming the line and
protecting ourselves...

649
01:25:12,622 --> 01:25:16,952
from İnegöl border to
Germian border...

650
01:25:16,952 --> 01:25:21,882
we'll push Turks to the east with
never-ending attacks.

651
01:25:21,882 --> 01:25:25,882
Their herds, goods, whatever they have...

652
01:25:25,882 --> 01:25:31,382
we'll fight to make them run away
without thinking to take anything with them!

653
01:25:32,741 --> 01:25:36,741
We'll make them migrate to where
they came.

654
01:25:36,741 --> 01:25:40,741
Until they run back to the
hell they came from!

655
01:25:41,525 --> 01:25:46,785
This is it. This is the great battle
we have been waiting for.

656
01:25:47,672 --> 01:25:53,192
Your words reminded me of the Helenic
pride that I've forgotten.

657
01:25:53,982 --> 01:25:57,982
Really bold words.

658
01:25:58,299 --> 01:26:02,299
You amazed us, Commander Dukas.

659
01:26:04,537 --> 01:26:11,177
Victory will be ours!

660
01:26:16,648 --> 01:26:21,948
According to our intelligence, Nikola
is forming a defensive line.

661
01:26:21,948 --> 01:26:25,948
That will take two weeks at least.

662
01:26:25,948 --> 01:26:29,818
In the meantime, Dukas will reach
İnegöl with his army.

663
01:26:29,818 --> 01:26:36,488
15 days will be enough for us to prepare.
You will face their defensive line.

664
01:26:36,891 --> 01:26:41,341
You'll follow the enemy and gather
information.

665
01:26:41,858 --> 01:26:45,858
When the night falls,
send good warriors to the other side...

666
01:26:45,858 --> 01:26:49,858
and take some captives.

667
01:26:49,858 --> 01:26:57,598
If we can make them talk, then we'll
find out about their plans.

668
01:27:00,851 --> 01:27:04,851
But, Umur Bey...

669
01:27:04,851 --> 01:27:11,571
you have the biggest responsibiltiy.
You'll keep an eye around Domaniç

670
01:27:11,571 --> 01:27:16,411
Our claws will be upon them until
the battle starts.

671
01:27:16,411 --> 01:27:21,791
And when it begins, we'll be upon
them with 'Allahu Akbar's!

672
01:27:21,999 --> 01:27:27,309
-Don't worry, Osman Bey.
-Alright, alright, Umur Bey.

673
01:27:27,784 --> 01:27:33,064
My alps are ready for any mission
you'll give, Osman Bey.

674
01:27:33,330 --> 01:27:37,330
Don't worry about it's being
difficult, Osman Bey.

675
01:27:37,330 --> 01:27:40,460
We'll make home from
whatever we get.

676
01:27:40,460 --> 01:27:46,500
All the borders will be our home and
all the ghazis are our alps.

677
01:27:46,500 --> 01:27:49,920
Thank you, my bey.

678
01:27:49,920 --> 01:27:54,500
Alps who came from Germiyan
has the same sense.

679
01:27:54,500 --> 01:27:58,500
Turan Alp will prepare
the alps for the battle.

680
01:27:58,500 --> 01:28:04,260
-As you order, my bey.
-Thank you, thank you, Turan Alp.

681
01:28:09,730 --> 01:28:13,730
My beys, my ghazis...

682
01:28:15,042 --> 01:28:20,742
the time is coming,
the enemy is gathering.

683
01:28:22,726 --> 01:28:29,206
Among all the battles that have
come...

684
01:28:29,797 --> 01:28:33,497
this will be the greatest.

685
01:28:34,203 --> 01:28:39,653
The eyes of our ghazi ancestors
will be upon us.

686
01:28:44,454 --> 01:28:48,454
I'll take İznik for the Turks.

687
01:28:48,454 --> 01:28:52,454
This dagger that belonged
to the great sultan...

688
01:28:52,454 --> 01:28:57,484
our ghazi ancestor, Kutalmışoğlu
Süleyman Shah...

689
01:28:57,484 --> 01:29:03,854
should remind you of our centuries
old cause.

690
01:29:05,679 --> 01:29:12,859
For the memory of all the warriors
who took these lands for us.

691
01:29:14,462 --> 01:29:17,982
Allahu Akbar!

692
01:29:17,982 --> 01:29:22,462
Victory belongs to those who have faith.

693
01:29:22,462 --> 01:29:26,462
Allahu Akbar.

694
01:29:29,841 --> 01:29:33,841
Around Domaniç
15 days later

695
01:30:00,965 --> 01:30:04,965
-Salam Alaikum.
-Alaikum Salam, Osman Bey.

696
01:30:07,931 --> 01:30:12,491
-You are just in time, Osman Bey.
-How many are they?

697
01:30:12,491 --> 01:30:18,681
-Around 40.
-They aren't Nikola's soldiers.

698
01:30:19,621 --> 01:30:22,901
-Must be the vanguard.
-Let's be quick.

699
01:30:22,987 --> 01:30:27,547
-Alps! Stay here.
-Alright, my bey.

700
01:30:59,805 --> 01:31:03,265
They chose a good spot.

701
01:31:03,265 --> 01:31:07,265
I've been personally watching...

702
01:31:07,265 --> 01:31:11,265
their moves in the last
three days.

703
01:31:11,265 --> 01:31:15,265
Thank you, Umur Bey.
Thank you.

704
01:31:15,655 --> 01:31:20,805
-Found anyhing?
-As you said...

705
01:31:20,805 --> 01:31:23,615
they must be the vanguard.

706
01:31:29,563 --> 01:31:34,553
Brother, what do you think?

707
01:31:36,175 --> 01:31:40,175
Their intention will be to meet
with the main army.

708
01:31:41,067 --> 01:31:47,397
-This is a secret place.
-If so, what will be their target?

709
01:31:49,553 --> 01:31:54,613
Lately, the intensity among
the soldiers...

710
01:31:54,788 --> 01:31:58,788
grew around Domaniç

711
01:31:58,788 --> 01:32:03,878
I say that we should attack and
end them here.

712
01:32:03,922 --> 01:32:07,922
Not now, Umut Bey.
Not now.

713
01:32:13,588 --> 01:32:17,008
What's on your mind, Osman Bey?

714
01:32:17,008 --> 01:32:21,588
Dukas' army isn't here yet.

715
01:32:21,588 --> 01:32:25,268
Watch every step they take,
Umur Bey.

716
01:32:25,629 --> 01:32:28,629
Alright.

717
01:32:40,500 --> 01:32:44,220
The armies of Yaso and the other
lords will wait here for your orders.

718
01:32:44,220 --> 01:32:47,880
It will take half a day to reach.

719
01:32:50,324 --> 01:32:54,324
Dear Dukas, welcome.

720
01:33:00,286 --> 01:33:04,286
Our defensive line is almost ready.

721
01:33:04,286 --> 01:33:08,286
Tomorrow, we'll hurt Osman before
the great battle.

722
01:33:08,338 --> 01:33:12,338
Why tomorrow, Dukas?

723
01:33:12,338 --> 01:33:17,338
-Don't tell me the soldiers aren't ready.
-We are ready. Why tomorrow?

724
01:33:17,338 --> 01:33:21,688
Osman knows you very well.
He can guess your moves.

725
01:33:21,688 --> 01:33:25,688
-You fought a lot.
-He doesn't know Commander Dukas.

726
01:33:25,688 --> 01:33:29,688
-The vanguard will hit him good.
-So?

727
01:33:29,688 --> 01:33:35,278
Before my army reaches here, I'll
blur his mind with this attack.

728
01:33:35,278 --> 01:33:39,598
The information my spies bring
me shows everything.

729
01:33:39,598 --> 01:33:43,598
Osman Bey positioned his alps
all the way.

730
01:33:43,598 --> 01:33:47,598
-They change positions and ambush.
-They are ambushing ghosts.

731
01:33:48,089 --> 01:33:53,639
-They don't know my numbers.
-Like a blind eagle.

732
01:33:53,639 --> 01:33:57,550
Now is the time to hit a small
but effective blow.

733
01:33:59,148 --> 01:34:04,388
-Good.
-Nikola, finish preperations.

734
01:34:05,125 --> 01:34:09,125
Athnos, come with me.
Let's see the defensive line together.

735
01:34:17,102 --> 01:34:21,102
-How long will we endure this insolence?
-Shh...

736
01:34:22,219 --> 01:34:26,219
A little bit longer.

737
01:34:38,844 --> 01:34:43,744
Lord Leo is still not here.
If he is exposed...

738
01:34:44,766 --> 01:34:48,766
Then, Nikola will kill him without
blinking an eye.

739
01:35:01,984 --> 01:35:05,984
Lord Leo!

740
01:35:14,428 --> 01:35:20,218
I'm glad to see you. We were afraid
something happened.

741
01:35:20,395 --> 01:35:25,005
If you can't stop Nikola and Dukas,
much worse will happen to me.

742
01:35:25,123 --> 01:35:29,123
I'm surrounded by Nikola's spies.

743
01:35:29,123 --> 01:35:32,643
It was difficult to come
here, Osman Bey.

744
01:35:33,028 --> 01:35:37,028
-Any news?
-Unfortunately, yes.

745
01:35:37,028 --> 01:35:41,028
I heard from Lord Athnos that...

746
01:35:41,028 --> 01:35:45,028
Nikola and Dukas are planning to
attack Domaniç

747
01:35:45,028 --> 01:35:49,728
He tried me to convince joining
the battle.

748
01:35:51,651 --> 01:35:55,321
Just as we guessed.

749
01:35:55,321 --> 01:36:00,151
Tomorrow, they'll move for the attack.

750
01:36:00,373 --> 01:36:06,633
Our intelligence says that the attack
will be around Domaniç

751
01:36:08,708 --> 01:36:11,948
We proved it with your words.

752
01:36:11,948 --> 01:36:16,708
-Should we inform other beys?
-Now is the time.

753
01:36:16,708 --> 01:36:20,708
-Everyone should be ready for battle.
-Alright.

754
01:36:35,940 --> 01:36:39,560
-Göktuğ?
-Yes, brother.

755
01:36:39,560 --> 01:36:45,180
-There is something off with you. Tell me.
-No, brother.

756
01:36:45,965 --> 01:36:49,965
Göktuğ, tell me.

757
01:37:05,440 --> 01:37:09,990
Brother, I bought this at Konya.

758
01:37:12,767 --> 01:37:16,767
For Zoey.

759
01:37:17,591 --> 01:37:20,841
But I couldn't give it to her.

760
01:37:22,189 --> 01:37:25,789
I want to give it to her tomorrow,
before going to battle.

761
01:37:25,789 --> 01:37:30,629
-But you don't have the courage.
-Brother, you know me.

762
01:37:30,629 --> 01:37:34,629
I can charge into an army.

763
01:37:34,629 --> 01:37:39,699
But when it's about love, I don't know
what to do.

764
01:37:40,322 --> 01:37:45,652
Brother, a ghazi shouldn't
look behind.

765
01:37:46,329 --> 01:37:50,659
-Go and tell her.
-How, brother? How?

766
01:37:51,330 --> 01:37:55,330
Brother, do you want me to go and
tell? What do you want?

767
01:38:00,757 --> 01:38:04,757
-I'll ask something if you won't get mad.
-I won't. Ask away.

768
01:38:07,319 --> 01:38:12,299
Brother, tell me. How did you speak
to my Gonca sister?

769
01:38:12,821 --> 01:38:16,821
Tell me. Show me a way!

770
01:38:17,305 --> 01:38:21,305
Now, firstly tell me.

771
01:38:23,655 --> 01:38:26,845
Does the girl love you too?

772
01:38:29,615 --> 01:38:32,995
I don't know brother.

773
01:38:33,525 --> 01:38:40,705
But when I look into her eyes, I find
myself lost.

774
01:38:44,582 --> 01:38:48,582
Look, brother.

775
01:38:48,582 --> 01:38:52,582
Alp's heart doesn't make his tongue
speak, but his arms.

776
01:38:54,410 --> 01:38:58,410
If the girl loves you...

777
01:38:58,410 --> 01:39:03,030
she'll understand not what you say,
but what you feel.

778
01:39:04,275 --> 01:39:09,925
Not what you are able to express
but what you aren't, Göktuğ.

779
01:39:11,156 --> 01:39:15,156
Brother, face her.

780
01:39:15,156 --> 01:39:19,156
And tell everything you want.

781
01:39:22,843 --> 01:39:26,843
Thank you, brother.
Thank you.

782
01:39:37,582 --> 01:39:40,582
I should leave then.

783
01:39:41,714 --> 01:39:45,714
-Good night, Gonca sister.
-Thank you.

784
01:39:56,248 --> 01:39:59,778
What's wrong with Göktuğ?

785
01:39:59,778 --> 01:40:03,098
He has a trouble with
no cure, Gonca.

786
01:40:06,043 --> 01:40:10,043
What is it?

787
01:40:15,158 --> 01:40:18,768
My brother is in love.

788
01:40:20,388 --> 01:40:23,248
God bless you.

789
01:40:25,052 --> 01:40:29,752
Why would they be helpless?
They can marry and it will be solved.

790
01:40:46,110 --> 01:40:50,940
-Gonca.
-Yes.

791
01:40:55,589 --> 01:40:59,829
Does the fire of love end when you marry?

792
01:41:04,166 --> 01:41:09,086
I don't know. You tell me.

793
01:41:11,743 --> 01:41:14,473
Does it?

794
01:41:14,473 --> 01:41:20,793
I wish I was with you in this war,
fighting side by side.

795
01:41:20,793 --> 01:41:24,793
You gave me the greatest
evangel!

796
01:41:24,793 --> 01:41:29,723
And now, you are carrying the
most valuable one.

797
01:41:30,667 --> 01:41:34,667
This is more valuable than the battle.

798
01:41:35,032 --> 01:41:40,662
If Allah blesses me with
a son...

799
01:41:45,713 --> 01:41:49,713
if I have a son...

800
01:41:50,591 --> 01:41:54,591
if I'm destined to fight side
by side with my son...

801
01:42:01,577 --> 01:42:05,577
You will be, Osman.
You will.

802
01:42:10,154 --> 01:42:16,664
Inshallah.

803
01:42:20,080 --> 01:42:24,080
After having your heir...

804
01:42:25,500 --> 01:42:29,500
will you come to this tent...

805
01:42:30,401 --> 01:42:34,401
and still care for me?

806
01:43:19,191 --> 01:43:23,951
Help me, my Allah.

807
01:43:31,715 --> 01:43:37,105
Come on, Göktuğ.
With the name of Allah. Come on.

808
01:43:48,431 --> 01:43:51,271
Göktuğ.

809
01:43:53,859 --> 01:43:58,279
We meet a lot.
Is this a coincidence?

810
01:43:58,940 --> 01:44:04,140
It's not a coincidence.
I know you walk here every morning.

811
01:44:05,163 --> 01:44:08,563
Are you watching me, Göktuğ Alp?

812
01:44:08,563 --> 01:44:13,693
I don't have bad intentions. You know,
in spring, you see pretty flowers.

813
01:44:13,693 --> 01:44:19,923
You want to look at them. You don't have
bad intentions. You like to see nice things.

814
01:44:42,128 --> 01:44:46,128
Same as this.

815
01:44:46,434 --> 01:44:49,864
I wanted to buy it when I saw it.

816
01:45:20,057 --> 01:45:24,427
I opened the gate of Kulucahisar,
I got shot with arrows many times.

817
01:45:27,060 --> 01:45:30,480
But the gates of my heart...

818
01:45:33,571 --> 01:45:36,991
was opened by you.

819
01:45:42,802 --> 01:45:47,882
By the look of you, you are afraid
of getting shot again.

820
01:45:47,882 --> 01:45:52,492
I'm not afraid of the arrows of
the enemy but...

821
01:45:52,492 --> 01:45:54,862
the words of your mouth.

822
01:45:59,489 --> 01:46:02,709
You should know.

823
01:46:07,466 --> 01:46:11,466
Where are you going?

824
01:46:13,487 --> 01:46:16,897
To my bey, for duty.

825
01:46:29,765 --> 01:46:32,915
Göktuğ.

826
01:46:43,072 --> 01:46:46,872
I'll be awaiting your return.

827
01:47:12,953 --> 01:47:16,243
Thank Allah.

828
01:47:23,827 --> 01:47:27,567
Now is the time.

829
01:47:38,893 --> 01:47:44,003
What's wrong, Bala?
Do you doubt the victory?

830
01:47:45,524 --> 01:47:50,014
When have you lost a battle after
getting betrayed, Osman?

831
01:47:51,335 --> 01:47:56,735
-I would never doubt you.
-Not at all. Not at all.

832
01:47:58,835 --> 01:48:04,420
I doubt us, but not you.

833
01:48:04,552 --> 01:48:09,912
That was a blade wound.
Stop torturing yourself, Bala.

834
01:48:10,562 --> 01:48:15,652
Don't wound me when I'm going
to battle.

835
01:48:21,004 --> 01:48:25,004
-May I enter, my bey?
-Come in.

836
01:48:27,852 --> 01:48:32,532
-My bey, your alps are awaiting orders.
-Mount. I'm coming.

837
01:48:40,598 --> 01:48:44,598
May Allah sharpen your sword, Osman Bey.

838
01:48:44,598 --> 01:48:48,678
Break the wings of the heathens.
I await your victory.

839
01:48:48,678 --> 01:48:53,608
This is what I want to hear from you.

840
01:48:58,939 --> 01:49:03,969
-May Allah protect you.
-You too, Osman Bey.

841
01:49:23,389 --> 01:49:28,599
This is your day, Dukas.
And the word is yours.

842
01:49:34,955 --> 01:49:38,955
We formed our defensive line.

843
01:49:38,955 --> 01:49:42,955
We'll kick the Turks out of our
invaded lands!

844
01:49:42,955 --> 01:49:50,155
Until our army comes from Macedonia,
we'll play a bloody game.

845
01:49:50,155 --> 01:49:54,155
We'll lure them into our trap!

846
01:50:05,047 --> 01:50:10,267
Are you ready to destroy the Turks?

847
01:50:11,848 --> 01:50:15,848
Are you ready for victory?

848
01:50:16,679 --> 01:50:32,566
Victory!

849
01:50:41,113 --> 01:50:44,303
-Bala.
-Gonca.

850
01:50:44,430 --> 01:50:49,610
I followed Zoey. She left the
tribe today.

851
01:50:50,752 --> 01:50:55,362
I followed her to Söğüt.
But...

852
01:50:55,979 --> 01:50:59,789
She removed her trace in side alleys.

853
01:51:00,619 --> 01:51:04,019
She removed her trace, huh?

854
01:51:04,115 --> 01:51:09,535
-So, it's certain now?
-I'm sure, Bala.

855
01:53:01,173 --> 01:53:05,773
My bey, Byzantine dogs were seen
at Karaçam Valley.

856
01:53:06,984 --> 01:53:12,634
Around the place that Umur Bey
noticed. They'll attack the villages nearby.

857
01:53:14,348 --> 01:53:19,548
-Turan, Saltuk.
-My bey.

858
01:53:19,667 --> 01:53:22,537
-Inform the alps.
-As you order, my bey.

859
01:53:22,537 --> 01:53:26,537
-You know what to do.
-Yes, my bey.

860
01:53:27,429 --> 01:53:31,939
Now is the time for battle!

861
01:53:31,939 --> 01:53:34,529
Come on!

862
01:54:26,730 --> 01:54:30,230
It's not as big as we thought.

863
01:54:31,984 --> 01:54:35,534
What are you thinking, Osman Bey.

864
01:54:41,608 --> 01:54:46,678
Neither Nikola nor Ducas
are with them.

865
01:54:49,636 --> 01:54:53,636
What will we do, Osman Bey?

866
01:55:01,567 --> 01:55:05,567
Firstly, we'll take care of them.

867
01:55:05,567 --> 01:55:09,407
Show no mercy.

868
01:55:11,663 --> 01:55:16,303
Umur Bey, you will attack from the
rear with your alps.

869
01:55:16,303 --> 01:55:20,303
Turan Alp will aid you with his alps.

870
01:55:20,632 --> 01:55:25,382
Alps, come on.
May Allah bless our efforts.

871
01:55:49,363 --> 01:55:52,253
Battle formation!

872
01:57:12,941 --> 01:57:16,941
-God damn it! How could that happen?
-Don't you understand?

873
01:57:16,941 --> 01:57:20,351
Dukas used as bait!

874
01:57:44,030 --> 01:57:48,030
Allah is immortal!

875
01:58:23,450 --> 01:58:29,080
Osman's alps took measure around
the village but it's not enough.

876
01:58:29,080 --> 01:58:33,080
-Around 20 are protecting the village.
-We'll attack together.

877
01:58:33,080 --> 01:58:35,410
No one should survive.

878
01:58:35,917 --> 01:58:39,357
There are Christians living in
this village.

879
01:58:39,357 --> 01:58:44,947
If they accept to live with Turks,
they deserve to die with Turks, Nikola.

880
01:58:46,006 --> 01:58:50,186
Then, let's finish this.

881
01:58:50,186 --> 01:58:54,526
It's better if you stay here and
protect the rear.

882
01:58:54,526 --> 01:58:58,526
You can come to celebrate my
victory when I'm finished.

883
01:59:02,922 --> 01:59:06,602
As you wish, Dukas.

884
01:59:06,602 --> 01:59:10,922
Soldiers! We are moving!

885
02:01:32,112 --> 02:01:37,292
Osman Bey, you don't seem happy
for the victory.

886
02:01:38,068 --> 02:01:42,908
Are you doubting our victory, Osman Bey?

887
02:01:56,107 --> 02:02:02,037
There is something behind this.

888
02:02:05,361 --> 02:02:09,361
They lured us into making a mistake...

889
02:02:09,883 --> 02:02:13,883
and made a sneaky move, I'm afraid.

890
02:02:49,556 --> 02:02:54,546
Let me go!
Let me go!

891
02:03:34,558 --> 02:03:39,708
Commander Dukas!
This victory is yours!

892
02:03:40,373 --> 02:03:44,373
Osman will think that we'll attack...

893
02:03:44,373 --> 02:03:49,363
the Turkish villages around Domaniç.
-I'll transfer this information.

894
02:03:50,076 --> 02:03:54,076
Osman will take the bait.

895
02:03:54,076 --> 02:03:58,506
We'll send soldiers to Domaniç.
A small unit will position there.

896
02:03:58,506 --> 02:04:02,506
We'll take Osman's attention
to there.

897
02:04:02,506 --> 02:04:08,856
-Osman will make his plans for them.
-But the real target will be Kulucahisar.

898
02:04:09,730 --> 02:04:13,730
Great. Great.

899
02:04:14,169 --> 02:04:18,169
I knew that you are a great commander,
Dukas.

900
02:04:24,288 --> 02:04:28,728
-Your plan worked great.
-I must admit.

901
02:04:29,237 --> 02:04:33,237
Athnos has a great part in it.

902
02:04:33,798 --> 02:04:39,188
He managed to deceive Osman
through Leo.

903
02:04:40,221 --> 02:04:43,711
It's still better to not
get so excited.

904
02:04:43,711 --> 02:04:48,431
-What do you mean?
-Osman hasn't moved yet.

905
02:04:48,803 --> 02:04:52,803
Osman made you so afraid, it seems.

906
02:04:53,044 --> 02:04:57,044
I wanted to warn you before
Osman pokes your eyes, Dukas.

907
02:05:05,163 --> 02:05:10,413
Osman and his alps are at Domaniç,
as we planned.

908
02:05:11,555 --> 02:05:16,265
When he finds out, he'll come after me.

909
02:05:17,382 --> 02:05:21,002
It will be his time.

910
02:05:22,966 --> 02:05:27,726
In a great battlefield,
I will end them all.

911
02:05:27,726 --> 02:05:31,916
Do you know what Turks say
in such situations, Dukas?

912
02:05:32,430 --> 02:05:35,650
Inshallah.

913
02:05:37,412 --> 02:05:41,412
Inshallah, Dukas.
Inshallah.

914
02:05:42,756 --> 02:05:45,566
Inshallah.

915
02:06:58,744 --> 02:07:01,454
What's wrong, Aygül?

916
02:07:02,010 --> 02:07:04,300
Nikola!

917
02:07:05,292 --> 02:07:10,082
Nikola and Dukas attacked villages
near Kulucahisar.

918
02:07:16,313 --> 02:07:20,313
It was a trap, Osman Bey.
It was a trap.

919
02:07:20,605 --> 02:07:23,725
You were right, Osman Bey.

920
02:07:33,200 --> 02:07:38,360
-What's the situation?
-They burned everything.

921
02:07:39,936 --> 02:07:43,556
So many deaths...

922
02:07:44,005 --> 02:07:48,785
They even killed the innocent
Christians and the children...

923
02:07:48,785 --> 02:07:52,785
What are you saying, Aygül?

924
02:08:22,826 --> 02:08:27,556
We hunted...

925
02:08:28,978 --> 02:08:32,978
but...

926
02:08:33,440 --> 02:08:37,440
we became the hunted.

927
02:08:49,763 --> 02:08:56,443
I swear that...
I swear that...

928
02:08:57,420 --> 02:09:02,260
if this trap doesn't sharpen our blades...

929
02:09:03,720 --> 02:09:08,920
if we don't avenge the
lost blood...

930
02:09:11,330 --> 02:09:16,320
may our blades take our lives!

931
02:09:16,939 --> 02:09:25,855
May our blades take our lives!